"Identify the CPC technology areas with the highest exponential moving average of patent filings each year, and return only the CPC group codes at level 5 whose best year is 2022. Count each patent once per CPC group, considering only its primary CPC codes (the entries flagged first = true). For each group, compute the exponential moving average (smoothing factor 0.2) over the complete range of years from the group's first filing year to its last, counting years without filings as zero, and initialize the average with the first year's count. The best year is the year with the highest exponential moving average (the earliest such year in case of a tie)."
